{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dream On</strong> is a short first-person walking simulator focused on introspection and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll embark on a meditative journey through a symbolic dreamscape, exploring surreal environments that reflect the inner world of fears, hopes, and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/DreamOnBridge.gif?t=1745674026\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A brief experience \u2014 the game can be completed in about 3-5 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Linear narrative with symbolic visuals and ambient storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Immersive sound design \u2014 no dialogue or text, just music and sound to guide your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Simple controls \u2014 walk, look around, and interact with key objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A meaningful choice at the end \u2014 what will you wish for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/DreamOnPeople.gif?t=1745674026\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dream On is not about challenges or puzzles. It's a quiet space to reflect, feel, and simply <i>be</i>. Perfect for players looking for a short emotional escape or a peaceful moment before sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/DreamOnFence.gif?t=1745674026\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659920?t=1745674026","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstat